1
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:09,430
YAMU!

2
00:00:09,513 --> 00:00:11,717
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

3
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:12,680
YAMU!

4
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,558
You're on the move!

5
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:07,700
As we speak, thousands of Kaiba Corp
computer files are being deleted.

6
00:01:08,060 --> 00:01:11,360
Sanction no small part
to my undefeatable virus.

7
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:12,600
We'll see.

8
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:14,860
If what Siegfried says is true,

9
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:17,497
then Yugi has to get rid
of that castle card pronto,

10
00:01:17,580 --> 00:01:19,521
or Kaiba's gonna lose everything.

11
00:01:19,660 --> 00:01:21,131
There's only one problem.

12
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:24,791
Siegfried reprogrammed the card
and made it indestructible.

13
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:28,630
Seto?

14
00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:31,300
Running from our problems, are we?

15
00:01:31,440 --> 00:01:32,969
I don't run from anything.

16
00:01:33,180 --> 00:01:36,356
When I'm faced with a problem,
I eliminate the source.

17
00:01:37,660 --> 00:01:38,740
Seto, wait up!

18
00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:43,000
Don't you fools realize I've already won?

19
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:47,157
I know you didn't mean to
trigger that virus, Leon.

20
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:49,820
But with your help, I
think we can stop it.

21
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:52,591
I need you to duel with all of your heart.

22
00:01:52,740 --> 00:01:53,570
You're right!

23
00:01:53,653 --> 00:01:55,937
As long as Leon stays
strong and doesn't give up,

24
00:01:56,020 --> 00:01:58,960
we're bound to find that
card's weakness. Yes.

25
00:02:00,580 --> 00:02:01,460
Thanks, Yugi.

26
00:02:04,220 --> 00:02:07,057
I guess there's nothing I
can do to change the past,

27
00:02:07,140 --> 00:02:09,787
but I can work with you
to change the future.

28
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:12,857
Because I know there's a
solution to this whole thing.

29
00:02:12,940 --> 00:02:15,411
And if anyone can figure it out, it's you.

30
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:17,980
Then let's do it.

31
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:19,330
My move!

32
00:02:21,860 --> 00:02:26,360
Golden Castle of Stralberg's special
effect is now automatically activated!

33
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:32,205
What's the deal with
Yuki's Dark Magician Girl?

34
00:02:43,660 --> 00:02:44,660
No way!

35
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:47,660
Your Dark Magician Girl's destroyed!

36
00:02:47,900 --> 00:02:49,957
And Cinderella's got her slippers back!

37
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:54,334
As long as my new and improved castle
remains on the field, both players'

38
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,717
monsters will be forced
to do battle each turn.

39
00:02:56,800 --> 00:03:01,094
And as an added twist, whenever one
of your monsters is forced to attack,

40
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:04,777
half of that monster's attack points
are then deducted from your life points.

41
00:03:04,860 --> 00:03:07,137
And then the monster itself is destroyed.

42
00:03:07,220 --> 00:03:09,217
Can he really make a card do that?

43
00:03:09,300 --> 00:03:10,940
I think he just did, Joey.

44
00:03:16,340 --> 00:03:17,170
All right.

45
00:03:17,253 --> 00:03:19,417
Initiate protocol KC-514.

46
00:03:19,500 --> 00:03:21,837
We can't allow this thing
to spread any further.

47
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:22,750
Yes, sir.

48
00:03:22,980 --> 00:03:25,057
Sato, what can I do to help out?

49
00:03:25,140 --> 00:03:29,600
Take charge of E-level security and
make sure every firewall stays active.

50
00:03:30,260 --> 00:03:31,360
Leave it to me.

51
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,320
Poor Leon.

52
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:39,217
He would have done anything
to help his big brother.

53
00:03:39,300 --> 00:03:41,077
And how did Ziegfrey repay him?

54
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:42,600
With lies and betrayal.

55
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:45,180
My brother would never do that to me.

56
00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:48,780
How do I destroy that castle?

57
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:51,437
Magic and trap cards
are useless against it.

58
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:55,640
And any monster I summon will
self-destruct and drain my life points.

59
00:03:56,060 --> 00:03:57,140
What's the use?

60
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:59,820
Leon, we can't give up.

61
00:04:00,100 --> 00:04:01,577
Every card has a weakness.

62
00:04:01,660 --> 00:04:04,637
And as long as we continue
to duel to the very end,

63
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:07,191
we'll find a way to tear that castle down.

64
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:10,200
Now I'll place this face
down and end my turn.

65
00:04:10,580 --> 00:04:13,680
You and I can do this. Yugi's right.

66
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,529
Quitting is not an option.

67
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:17,820
My move.

68
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:21,400
Pardon me,

69
00:04:21,880 --> 00:04:24,537
there's one more thing
you should know Golden

70
00:04:24,620 --> 00:04:28,237
Castle comes with a price
In order to keep it on the

71
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:31,097
field Half the cards in
one's deck must be sent

72
00:04:31,180 --> 00:04:35,160
directly to the graveyard at
the start of each turn Oh,

73
00:04:35,340 --> 00:04:37,880
and this cost must be paid by Yugi

74
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:41,120
You're kidding Congratulations,

75
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:45,260
Siegfried You've just taken
cheating to a whole new level Oh no,

76
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:49,400
it's the strongest card
I've ever seen What? Me too.

77
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:52,577
When Siegfried broke into
Kaiba's gaming system,

78
00:04:52,660 --> 00:04:56,542
he gave his golden castle powers
that no card has ever had before,

79
00:04:56,700 --> 00:04:59,420
giving the cardholder an unfair advantage.

80
00:05:00,100 --> 00:05:01,920
How could you do this to me?

81
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:07,107
You give the one with a disadvantage
here, so you should really be thanking me.

82
00:05:07,220 --> 00:05:09,620
He just lost half his deck!

83
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:13,400
Come on!

84
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:15,758
We can't let him get away with this!

85
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:19,180
I may be up here in the grandstand,

86
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:23,200
but that doesn't mean I can't
control this duel He's insane

87
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,260
Before long,

88
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:27,577
my brother will hold
the world championship

89
00:05:27,660 --> 00:05:30,980
crown But Kyber Corp
will crumble into ruins

90
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:40,400
If I were you, I'd summon a monster, Leon
This is a duel, after all He's right,

91
00:05:40,820 --> 00:05:41,650
go

92
00:05:43,060 --> 00:05:46,560
Well, I guess I'll summon
Forest Wolf in attack mode.

93
00:05:47,460 --> 00:05:52,500
Now the special effect of Golden Castle
forces Leon's monsters to attack!

94
00:05:52,820 --> 00:05:54,140
Oh, and look at this!

95
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,960
Yugi is defenseless!

96
00:06:04,980 --> 00:06:06,000
Forest Wolf!

97
00:06:06,380 --> 00:06:07,440
Finish him off!

98
00:06:08,140 --> 00:06:09,180
Yugi, no!

99
00:06:11,140 --> 00:06:14,660
I reveal my face-down card,
Dark Magic Retribution.

100
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,797
When my opponent's monster attacks,

101
00:06:16,880 --> 00:06:18,957
Dark Magic Retribution allows me to bring

102
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:21,880
one spellcaster back
from my card graveyard.

103
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:24,900
I choose my Dark Magician Girl.

104
00:06:30,620 --> 00:06:33,757
She only remains on the field
for the duration of the battle,

105
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:38,075
but that's long enough for me to
defend the remainder of my life points.

106
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:39,557
Be safe, guys.

107
00:06:39,640 --> 00:06:41,320
Yeah, but for how long?

108
00:06:41,660 --> 00:06:43,836
I can't even control my own monsters.

109
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,060
We'll be fine.

110
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:50,197
Now, since three turns have passed
since you played Spinning Wheel Spindle,

111
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,809
my Queen's Knight returns.

112
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:57,280
For my next move, I'll place these
two cards face down on the field.

113
00:06:57,920 --> 00:07:00,100
And then I'll activate this.

114
00:07:00,340 --> 00:07:02,180
It's my card of sanctity.

115
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:05,217
This magic card allows
both players to draw

116
00:07:05,300 --> 00:07:08,065
until we're each holding
six cards in our hand.

117
00:07:12,580 --> 00:07:15,620
Now I summon my King's
Knight in attack mode.

118
00:07:16,900 --> 00:07:20,657
And since King's Knight and Queen's
Knight are both on the field,

119
00:07:20,740 --> 00:07:24,211
I'm able to summon Jack's Knight
from my deck to join them.

120
00:07:30,740 --> 00:07:33,117
If you're through wasting everyone's time,

121
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:37,397
may I remind you your three knights
are useless against my golden castle?

122
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:40,220
I wouldn't be so sure. Huh?

123
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:44,140
Now I activate my Royal Straight!

124
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:48,777
This magic card allows me to summon an

125
00:07:48,860 --> 00:07:51,625
extremely powerful monster
from either my deck,

126
00:07:51,780 --> 00:07:53,740
my hand, or my graveyard.

127
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:57,680
So behold, Royal Straight Slasher!

128
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:11,797
and next i'll activate my royal
straight slasher's special ability now

129
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:15,537
when i send one monster from each of
the first five levels to the graveyard

130
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:21,237
slasher destroys every card on my
opponent's side of the field nice

131
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:26,000
thinking yuki trap and magic cards
don't work but monster abilities do

132
00:08:26,540 --> 00:08:28,460
Level 1, Karibu!

133
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:33,440
Level 2, my old vindictive magician!

134
00:08:35,500 --> 00:08:38,280
Level 3, giant soldier of stone!

135
00:08:39,520 --> 00:08:42,780
Level 4, my big shield gardener!

136
00:08:44,100 --> 00:08:46,920
Level 5, my curse of dragon!

137
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:59,220
Now, destroy all of his cards
Including his golden castle

138
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:09,260
Yes, see ya

139
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:16,860
No way

140
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:25,380
It's still there Siegfried was right
We'll never be able to destroy it

141
00:09:29,140 --> 00:09:31,300
How's that castle still standing?

142
00:09:31,680 --> 00:09:33,337
Shouldn't it have been destroyed?

143
00:09:33,420 --> 00:09:36,720
It should be a sand
castle Surprise, surprise

144
00:09:37,460 --> 00:09:38,290
No,

145
00:09:38,373 --> 00:09:42,077
don't even tell me when Siegfried
overwrote the card's data text

146
00:09:42,160 --> 00:09:45,177
He must have protected his golden
castle from monster effects

147
00:09:45,260 --> 00:09:49,217
also That means there's no way
to get rid of it Then I guess

148
00:09:49,300 --> 00:09:54,300
the duel's done right you not if
I activate this card time travel

149
00:09:55,860 --> 00:09:59,097
It allows me to temporarily
remove one of my monsters

150
00:09:59,180 --> 00:10:02,220
from the field until my
opponent's turn begins

151
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:04,660
That ends my turn.

152
00:10:04,900 --> 00:10:06,400
How noble of you.

153
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:10,717
Your monster would have been forced
to attack, and Leon would have lost.

154
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:12,360
But it was all in vain.

155
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:17,440
Now, Leon, begin your turn so you
can claim the championship crown.

156
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:21,380
I believe in you, Yugi.

157
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:24,217
I'm not sure how you're going to do it.

158
00:10:24,300 --> 00:10:26,980
But I know you'll put an end to his plan.

159
00:10:27,620 --> 00:10:29,520
Let's do this. Now.

160
00:10:29,940 --> 00:10:31,677
You know what happens next.

161
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:35,900
deposit half your deck in the
graveyard to keep my castle in play!

162
00:10:36,800 --> 00:10:41,160
Sorry to disappoint you, but
I can't do that. You must!

163
00:10:42,540 --> 00:10:43,580
You're wrong.

164
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:46,300
There's only one card left in my deck.

165
00:10:46,560 --> 00:10:50,777
That makes it impossible for me to
deposit half of it into the graveyard.

166
00:10:50,860 --> 00:10:55,480
So I suppose your golden castle
of Stromberg has to go. What?

167
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:56,800
That can't be!

168
00:11:03,140 --> 00:11:04,240
You did it!

169
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:07,341
You mess with the best and
you fail like the rest.

170
00:11:08,020 --> 00:11:08,850
Hmm.

171
00:11:08,933 --> 00:11:10,082
It seemed like the perfect card.

172
00:11:10,260 --> 00:11:12,277
Siegfried designed it to be impervious to

173
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:14,877
the effects of every
other card in the game.

174
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:17,548
But in the end, everything
has its weakness.

175
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:18,550
Right.

176
00:11:18,633 --> 00:11:22,500
And with your grandson's refusal
to give in, he was able to find it.

177
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:29,619
We've got to cut this thing off
before any other files are destroyed.

178
00:11:31,760 --> 00:11:32,590
Good news!

179
00:11:32,673 --> 00:11:34,951
The virus just stopped dead in its tracks!

180
00:11:35,540 --> 00:11:36,370
Look!

181
00:11:36,453 --> 00:11:37,480
The castle's gone!

182
00:11:37,800 --> 00:11:40,440
I guess Yu-Gi found its
weak spot after all.

183
00:11:40,680 --> 00:11:42,280
So everything's safe now?

184
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:47,108
We'll know as soon as we launch the
backup system and reboot the KC mainframe.

185
00:11:47,380 --> 00:11:48,210
Let's move!

186
00:11:50,140 --> 00:11:52,920
Get a load of Zig Freak! Oh well!

187
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:55,847
You schemed, you cheated,
and you still lost!

188
00:11:57,460 --> 00:12:01,940
I admit I'm surprised Yugi was
able to dismantle my golden castle

189
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:05,400
But in the end, victory will be mine

190
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:08,760
Yeah, right, it's over,
pal On the contrary,

191
00:12:09,020 --> 00:12:11,917
my young and fashionably
challenged friend My conquest

192
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:15,440
has only just begun You
may have stopped my virus,

193
00:12:15,640 --> 00:12:17,480
but not soon enough By now,

194
00:12:17,680 --> 00:12:21,777
most of Kyber Corp's gaming data
has been permanently lost Not

195
00:12:21,860 --> 00:12:26,580
to mention Yugi has one card left
And this duel is not over yet.

196
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:31,042
When he's unable to draw a card
in the next turn, my brother wins!

197
00:12:31,940 --> 00:12:33,840
I can't let Yugi lose.

198
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:37,482
Not when my brother cheated
him out of his title.

199
00:12:37,620 --> 00:12:40,060
There's only one way I can save him.

200
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:42,060
I'm quitting!

201
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:43,957
Don't even think about it.

202
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:47,840
Now that your brother's castle
is gone, the real duel can begin.

203
00:12:48,460 --> 00:12:53,580
You owe it to yourself to fulfill your
dream and see this duel through to the end.

204
00:12:53,940 --> 00:12:54,770
Right?

205
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:55,950
Right.

206
00:12:56,060 --> 00:12:58,060
Then let's do it! Yeah!

207
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:01,000
I believe it was your move.

208
00:13:01,300 --> 00:13:05,947
But first, since the effect of my time
travel card is over, my slasher returns!

209
00:13:06,280 --> 00:13:08,360
Now I activate Monster Reborn!

210
00:13:08,560 --> 00:13:12,089
And I'll use it to bring
Cinderella back from the graveyard!

211
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:15,220
And with her back in action,

212
00:13:15,420 --> 00:13:18,949
I can automatically summon my
pumpkin carriage to the field!

213
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:25,080
Then I'll sacrifice Cinderella
and Pumpkin Carriage

214
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:30,800
That allows me to call
Hextrude to the field

215
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:35,840
Alright, Trudy Attack his slasher

216
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:45,777
And every time my Hextrude
blows away one of your

217
00:13:45,860 --> 00:13:49,300
monsters her attack strength
increases by 400 points.

218
00:13:50,820 --> 00:13:53,349
All right, Yugi, let's
see what you've got.

219
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:57,969
Yugi only has one card left, and he's
up against a monster with 3,000 points.

220
00:13:58,220 --> 00:14:00,800
And if he runs out of cards, he loses.

221
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:05,518
Dude, I hate to say it, but it looks
like there's a new champ in town.

222
00:14:07,460 --> 00:14:09,020
This is my last chance.

223
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:12,160
Please, heart of the cards, guide me.

224
00:14:12,700 --> 00:14:14,720
Here we go. Now!

225
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:20,480
First, I'll place one card face down.

226
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:25,660
And then I'll activate this
card, Emergency Provisions.

227
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:29,824
As long as I send one of my magic
or trap cards to the graveyard,

228
00:14:30,020 --> 00:14:33,726
Emergency Provisions will restore
a thousand of my life points.

229
00:14:33,940 --> 00:14:36,920
Next, I'll activate this, Monster Reborn.

230
00:14:37,260 --> 00:14:38,340
Uh, but why?

231
00:14:38,640 --> 00:14:41,560
I'll use it to summon a
monster you might know.

232
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:48,640
Dark Magician!

233
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:52,880
But wait, he only has
2,500 attack points, Yugi.

234
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:55,640
And my Hextrude has 3,000.

235
00:14:56,500 --> 00:14:58,600
Yes, but now I reveal this!

236
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:00,070
Necromancy!

237
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:04,435
Its special effect brings back four
random monsters from your graveyard.

238
00:15:04,620 --> 00:15:08,385
Then they're summoned to your
side of the field in defense mode.

239
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:12,617
But your Hextrude will
lose 600 attack points

240
00:15:12,700 --> 00:15:15,840
for every one of these
monsters that's destroyed.

241
00:15:17,160 --> 00:15:22,080
Now I reveal my next face-down
card, Diffusion Wave Motion!

242
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:25,640
By sacrificing 1,000 of my life points,

243
00:15:25,820 --> 00:15:28,597
Diffusion Wave Motion
allows me to use my Dark

244
00:15:28,680 --> 00:15:31,480
Magician to attack every
one of your monsters!

245
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:39,300
No, you can't! I can!

246
00:15:39,640 --> 00:15:40,900
And now I will!

247
00:15:41,300 --> 00:15:42,980
Dark Magician, attack!

248
00:15:58,080 --> 00:16:00,320
Yeah, baby! He won!

249
00:16:01,180 --> 00:16:03,040
Well, that's my grandson.

250
00:16:03,500 --> 00:16:05,400
He never ceases to amaze me.

251
00:16:06,680 --> 00:16:07,800
I'm ruined.

252
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:10,460
Well done.

253
00:16:11,520 --> 00:16:12,500
Thank you.

254
00:16:13,100 --> 00:16:13,930
I...

255
00:16:14,013 --> 00:16:14,843
well...

256
00:16:14,926 --> 00:16:19,640
You fought with honor under the toughest
of circumstances, and you never gave up.

257
00:16:19,920 --> 00:16:21,840
You should be proud of yourself.

258
00:16:22,320 --> 00:16:24,220
I don't know how to thank you.

259
00:16:30,580 --> 00:16:32,639
Oh, would you stop your whimpering?

260
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:35,620
It wasn't a total loss. What?

261
00:16:35,900 --> 00:16:39,537
It will take years of reprogramming
for Kyber Corp to restore

262
00:16:39,620 --> 00:16:42,997
what my devastatingly brilliant
computer virus has destroyed.

263
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:45,700
And in the meantime... You'll what?

264
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:47,600
Take all of my business away?

265
00:16:47,940 --> 00:16:51,377
You might have had a chance if your
plan actually worked, Siegfried.

266
00:16:51,460 --> 00:16:52,290
What?

267
00:16:52,780 --> 00:16:56,140
The moment I laid eyes on
you, I knew you were a snake.

268
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:58,917
So I was more than prepared
for your little scheme.

269
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:01,777
My entire computer network
has already been restored.

270
00:17:01,860 --> 00:17:04,180
So the only loser here is you.

271
00:17:04,460 --> 00:17:05,960
No, I don't believe you!

272
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:08,220
My strategy was flawless!

273
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:09,581
Siegfried, wait!

274
00:17:10,180 --> 00:17:11,337
Not now, Leon.

275
00:17:11,420 --> 00:17:14,717
Look, even if your plan did
work, nothing would have changed.

276
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:18,800
Can't you see our family's obsession
with the Kaiba's has ruined us?

277
00:17:20,460 --> 00:17:23,180
What's ruined us, Leon, is that I'm weak.

278
00:17:23,300 --> 00:17:24,980
I'll never beat Kaiba.

279
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:28,082
That's the first sensible
thing he said all week.

280
00:17:29,120 --> 00:17:30,179
Siegfried, listen.

281
00:17:30,520 --> 00:17:34,097
It's not our family's losses
that hurt us, it's our attitude.

282
00:17:34,180 --> 00:17:36,062
Strength isn't crushing someone.

283
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:37,310
See,

284
00:17:37,393 --> 00:17:39,177
dueling Yu-Gi taught
me the true strength is

285
00:17:39,260 --> 00:17:42,517
sticking with it when everyone
expects you to quit Sure,

286
00:17:42,600 --> 00:17:44,677
we may lose some of our
business to KaibaCorp,

287
00:17:44,760 --> 00:17:48,097
but losing is a reason to try
harder Not to give up, right?

288
00:17:48,180 --> 00:17:51,886
So let's go home and make
SchroederCorp the best company we can

289
00:17:52,160 --> 00:17:53,260
Thank you, Leon

290
00:17:59,420 --> 00:18:01,540
Roland, wrap this up Right

291
00:18:04,340 --> 00:18:08,660
The KC Grand Championship
has come to a close!

292
00:18:09,200 --> 00:18:13,160
The winner and still
world champ is Yukimoto!

293
00:18:34,340 --> 00:18:39,257
that was fun but i'm ready to go back
and i'm ready for a home-cooked meal

294
00:18:39,340 --> 00:18:43,517
let's not drag out this goodbye because
i'll be in your neighborhood in a few weeks

295
00:18:43,600 --> 00:18:46,577
cool why's that duke i've got a date

296
00:18:46,660 --> 00:18:50,697
with serenity say what ah what i wouldn't

297
00:18:50,780 --> 00:18:55,217
do to be a young man again i still feel
as nimble That is the day I was born.

298
00:18:55,300 --> 00:18:56,220
Uh, my back!

299
00:18:56,660 --> 00:18:59,072
I'm sorry, what was that you were saying?

300
00:18:59,840 --> 00:19:04,600
Yugi, don't forget you promised to email
me twice a day and visit every weekend.

301
00:19:05,040 --> 00:19:05,870
Sure.

302
00:19:05,953 --> 00:19:07,877
It's been interesting, to say the least.

303
00:19:07,960 --> 00:19:08,920
Bye, Shmoopy!

304
00:19:10,180 --> 00:19:11,010
Rebecca!

305
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:15,560
And Taya, I'm gonna miss you, too. Uh-huh.

306
00:19:16,140 --> 00:19:17,440
I bet you are.

307
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:19,346
Hey, what are you guys doing?

308
00:19:19,560 --> 00:19:23,677
I hook you up with our jet, and you
don't have the courtesy to board on time?

309
00:19:23,760 --> 00:19:25,337
Oops, sorry about that.

310
00:19:25,420 --> 00:19:26,773
I call the window seat.

311
00:19:26,900 --> 00:19:28,780
Come on, you got it last time.

312
00:19:34,040 --> 00:19:36,981
So now that you won the
championship, what's next?

313
00:19:37,140 --> 00:19:39,480
Well, Joey, the sky's the limit.
